# WHAT THIS IMAGE DEPENDS ON. The image installs requirements.txt, the lock
# made from this file (every package pinned, with hashes):
#     python3 scripts/image_locks.py lock hello_world
# Edit here, then re-lock; never edit requirements.txt by hand.
#
# hello_world needs nothing but the standard library.
#
# Each Actor pins its OWN dependencies here; the platform never installs them
# into its own environment. Real Actors will list httpx, playwright, etc.
